 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MyOyaJC6_7UQ7kNvwHlTUUm&_nc_oc=Adp24cc17E7RQ-T2YjN1UoO_6LYXl3t0_6LL217xPc5Lvu4M4J8fC4UU13k7x4RpYpU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHlkOAJ6z-sRXPueu0KBMH1A_OvUqTbMqo5bLVGjz4hVQ&oe=6A8C2881"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ijH3i5177-EQ7kNvwHKCtEg&_nc_oc=AdoE-D1rMeqKE73ycU9wQ3S-TAwd3d_TMJAvndGGz0_gdFNz02zI0FtnhQHdLRQcGrw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFrPIvTtgMgLu7jelFLBEVrEm1KRJZzUuHlmBWijzfNRw&oe=6A8C35E6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Cfd7zRUpfUcQ7kNvwHS5AkX&_nc_oc=AdoibsNS0Z3Gy4FnBpz_Y7hsI-N5u1lUklbtpwgi3R8nESZm5Jzt4Eymho_O0XqRwHA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEF_LG6HPG6T2pCR1qrEKehUZllaHie-pvinATbd9wnXw&oe=6A8C3FDC"}, {"fil